{
  "note": "Written by reference/ledgerd-client/scripts/gen-authres-conformance.ts from the TypeScript oracle (src/mail/authres.ts); do not hand-edit. Each vector is one Gmail header block: `headers`, or `headers_parts` (concatenate each part's `text` repeated `repeat` times). `expect` is gmailVerdict(block) {trusted, reason} and verifiedDomain(block). All inputs are synthetic. See README.md.",
